# MediaCare needs no environment variables yet.
#
# Rules for when it does:
# - Anything prefixed EXPO_PUBLIC_ is compiled into the app and readable by
#   anyone who has it. Never put secrets, API keys with spending power, or
#   credentials behind that prefix.
# - Real values go in .env.local (git-ignored), never in this file.
#
# Example (unused today):
# EXPO_PUBLIC_DEMO_MODE_DEFAULT=true
